Domain Entity StaffLeave [568]
    documentation 'This entity represents the recording of the dates of staff leave (e.g., 
                  'sick leave, personal time, vacation).
    date BegintDate [2690]
        documentation 'The begin date of the staff leave.
        is part of identity
    date EndDate [2691]
        documentation 'The end data of the staff leave.
        is optional
    enumeration StaffLeaveEventCategory [1508]
        documentation 'The code describing the type of leave taken, for example:
                      '
                      'Sick
                      '
                      'Personal
                      '
                      'Vacation.
        is part of identity
    shared string Reason named Reason [1509]
        documentation 'Expanded reason for the staff leave.
        is optional
    bool SubstituteAssigned [1511]
        documentation 'Indicator of whether a substitute was assigned during the period of staff leave.
        is optional
    reference Staff [1510]
        documentation 'The staff associated with this leave event.
        is part of identity